{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "iris-artframe-api-v1",
    "name": "Iris Art Frame API",
    "description": "Complete API collection for Iris Art Frame.\n\n## Import\n1. Postman → Import → select this file\n2. Set `baseUrl` (localhost: http://localhost:3001, production: https://iris-artframe.onrender.com)\n3. Run **Auth → Admin Login** first (saves `adminToken`)\n4. Run **Admin → Provision Device** with MAC + static IP (saves `deviceUuid`, `deviceId`, `deviceMac`)\n5. Run **Auth → User Register** or **User Login** (saves `userToken`)\n6. Run **Devices → Register Device to User** linking the provisioned frame\n7. Run **Device Hardware → Update Dynamic IP** to simulate frame reporting its LAN IP\n8. For image upload, pick a local JPG/PNG in the **Upload Image** request\n\n## Default test credentials\n- Admin: admin@iris-artframe.vercel.app / Admin@Iris2026\n- Sample MAC / device ID: B8:27:EB:AA:BB:FF (same value — MAC is the device identifier)\n- Sample static IP: 192.168.1.100 (unique per device, set at provisioning)\n\n## Auth headers\n- User/Admin routes: `Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}` or `{{adminToken}}`\n- Device hardware (dynamic IP): no auth — send `mac` + `dynamic_ip` in JSON body\n\n## IP addresses\n- **Static IP** — required at admin provisioning; embedded in QR payload; never changes\n- **Dynamic IP** — reported by hardware on boot via MAC address; can be updated manually in web UI",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "baseUrl", "value": "http://localhost:3001" },
    { "key": "userToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminToken", "value": "" },
    { "key": "deviceApiKey", "value": "" },
    { "key": "deviceUuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "deviceId", "value": "B8:27:EB:AA:BB:FF" },
    { "key": "deviceMac", "value": "B8:27:EB:AA:BB:FF" },
    { "key": "provisionStaticIp", "value": "192.168.1.100" },
    { "key": "dynamicIp", "value": "192.168.1.50" },
    { "key": "imageUuid", "value": "" },
    { "key": "imagePublicId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "jobId", "value": "" },
    { "key": "adminEmail", "value": "admin@iris-artframe.vercel.app" },
    { "key": "adminPassword", "value": "Admin@Iris2026" },
    { "key": "userEmail", "value": "test.user@iris-artframe.com" },
    { "key": "userPassword", "value": "TestUser@2026" },
    { "key": "userName", "value": "Test User" },
    { "key": "provisionMac", "value": "B8:27:EB:AA:BB:FF" },
    { "key": "provisionName", "value": "Living Room Frame" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Health Check",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [],
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/health",
            "description": "Public health check — no auth required."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('Service ok', () => {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.expect(json.status).to.eql('ok');",
                  "});"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Admin Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{adminEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{adminPassword}}\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login",
            "description": "Login as admin. Saves token to `adminToken`."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Login success', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "if (json.token) {",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('adminToken', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('adminToken saved');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('User is admin', () => pm.expect(json.user.role).to.eql('admin'));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "User Register",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"{{userName}}\",\n  \"email\": \"{{userEmail}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{userPassword}}\",\n  \"mobile\": \"+919876543210\"\n}"
            },
            "url": "{{baseUrl}}/api/auth/register",
            "description": "Register a new user. Change email if already registered. Saves `userToken`."
          },
          "response": [],
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 201) {",
                  "    const json = pm.response.json();",
                  "    pm.collectionVariables.set('userToken', json.token);",
                  "    console.log('userToken saved');",
                  "}",
                  "pm.test('Register or conflict', () => pm.expect([201, 409]).to.include(pm.response.code));"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "User Login",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "body": {
